<%#
  views/partials/footer.ejs

  The site footer on every page. The year is computed when the page is rendered, so it
  never goes out of date.

  Included by: every page view. Styles: site-footer in public/css/main.css (the page
  layout keeps it at the bottom even on a short page).
  Owner: SH.
%>
<footer class="site-footer">
    <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> The Web Daily</p>
</footer>
